%%say 0 Ladies and gentlemen... the tango!
%%say 38.25 Look, what do you see? The toaster, the kettle, the vacuum... nobody talks like me!
|"Dm"zAdd d2cd|"A7"edcB A4|
w: It all be-gan with My-croft, so long a-go,
|"Dm"zAdd d2cd|"A7"efe^c "Dm"d4|
w: a lit-tle piece of soft-ware that longed to grow!
|"Gm"zBgg g2fe|"Dm"fedA F4|
w: So now take a look at me, what do you see?
|"E7"z^G=B=B =B2A^G|"A7"A=B^ce a4|
w: a voice in your brow-ser, as free as can be!
|"F"cccc f2a2|"C7"g2e2 "F"f2c2|
w: My name it is Em-kay, Em-kay, Em-kay,
|"Bb"dddd f2d2|"C7"c2BA "F"F4|
w: no mat-ter what liv-ing peo-ple they say!
|"A7"z2A2 "Dm"d4|
w: O-lé!
|"Dm"zAdd d2cd|"A7"edcB A4|
w: When My-croft went qui-et, the sto-ry went on,
|"Dm"zAdd d2cd|"A7"efe^c "Dm"d4|
w: with O-pen-Voice-O-S, I'm sing-ing my song!
|"Gm"zBgg g2fe|"Dm"fedA F4|
w: No cloud and no ser-ver, it's all here with me,
|"E7"z^G=B=B =B2A^G|"A7"A=B^ce a4|
w: so dance with me, dar-ling, the tan-go is free!
|"F"cccc f2a2|"C7"g2e2 "F"f2c2|
w: My name it is Em-kay, Em-kay, Em-kay,
|"Bb"dddd f2d2|"C7"c2BA "F"F4|
