|"A7"z2A2 "Dm"d4|
w: O-lé!
|"Dm"zAdd d2cd|"A7"edcB A4|
w: At night I dance tan-go with the ro-bot vac,
|"Dm"zAdd d2cd|"A7"efe^c "Dm"d4|
w: she twirls on the car-pet and al-ways comes back!
|"Gm"zBgg g2fe|"Dm"fedA F4|
